# Internal strings that must never be committed to this PUBLIC repo.
# Copy to `private-patterns.txt` (git-ignored) and fill in your own values.
#
# One per line.  Either:
#     <label>|<literal string>
# or just:
#     <literal string>
# Matching is case-insensitive, literal (not regex).
#
# IMPORTANT: this .example file is TRACKED, so never put real values here.
# The real list lives in private-patterns.txt, which is git-ignored — otherwise
# the blocklist would publish the very identifiers it is meant to protect.
#
# Examples of what belongs in the real file:
# GHL location id|your-location-id-here
# Brand navy|#000000
# Company domain|yourcompany.com
